# Authoritative v26 Stata execution logs are reproducibility artifacts, not scratch.
# They are linked from the dashboard and must ship with the analysis package.
# The dashboard/ and docs/ copies are the dashboard/scripts/sync_dashboard.sh
# mirror of the same directory and must be un-ignored identically, or a fresh
# clone of this branch serves a dashboard whose own log download links 404
# even though the analysis package they mirror is fully tracked.
!06_FINAL_ANALYSIS_V26/02_STATA/logs/
!06_FINAL_ANALYSIS_V26/02_STATA/logs/*.log
!dashboard/v26/02_STATA/logs/
!dashboard/v26/02_STATA/logs/*.log
!docs/v26/02_STATA/logs/
!docs/v26/02_STATA/logs/*.log


